  "target_statement": "Let E be a finite-dimensional real inner-product space with its Borel sigma algebra, mu a probability measure, and eta>0. Write Phi(x,z)=(x,x+sqrt(eta)*z), pi=map Phi (mu.prod(stdGaussian E)), and R(x,y)=(x,2*x-y). Then R is involutive and map R pi=pi. The identification of this generative law with the paper's density (2.6) remains separate.",
